  RetirementWhy: 
  Rule: "max(pass 9, the Head): the headland at +11.0 inside its brow, the wave-cut
    platform round the foot, the Lantern Stack\u2019s plinth and the NE bar, as terrain.json
    has them; the neck (10-01): along its spine pass 3\u2019s ramp from +6 up to
    +11 over 16 m from the root line (the plank path\u2019s heights stand), and off
    the spine the ground eased from the spine\u2019s height back to pass 9\u2019s
    over shoulders about 12 m wide, on the plateau and down the shore\u2019s bank,
    wrapping 5 m round the root\u2019s corners; within the cannery\u2019s 21.06 m
    nothing is raised, and the neck fades out over the 6 beyond it. Its fourteen
    rock pools (pool.stp_ne_platform_01 to _14, the game\u2019s sites) are cut into
    the wave-cut platform by the game\u2019s platform Def (Ground_NePlatform: radius
    0.8 to 1.5 m, an outline 1.25 x 0.85 of it wobbling by 0.14, 0.2 to 0.3 m deep
    below the spill, the floor irishmoss), on the game\u2019s pixels: the spill is
    the lowest ground on the rim raised by 0.3 of the rim\u2019s fall (at most 0.25
    m), a lip laid up to it where the rim stands lower, the floor cut to the spill
    less the depth (1 - q2), the rim\u2019s higher side the platform\u2019s back
    wall; stillWater.pools lists each"
